==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Celesse (Enemy)|Celesses]] spawn after 4 seconds<sup>120f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Nono (Enemy)|Nonos]] spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Alois (Enemy)|Alois]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Celesse (Enemy)|Celesses]] spawn, delay 8~16 seconds<sup>240f~480f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Nono (Enemy)|Nonos]] spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

